  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A loop of wire lies in a magnetic field directed into the plane of the page. The loop carries a current in a clockwise direction.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The magnetic force acting on the wire tends to</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">rotate the loop about the X axis.</li><li data-label=\"B\">rotate the loop about the Y axis.</li><li data-label=\"C\">reduce the radius of the loop.</li><li data-label=\"D\">increase the radius of the loop.</li></ol>"
